  "description": "Tests trample + deathtouch combat math (CR 702.19c × 702.2c). Glissa has first strike + deathtouch natively. Ohran Frostfang has deathtouch AND grants deathtouch to all creatures you control. Pair with Loxodon Warhammer (grants trample) on a creature that already has DT (Glissa, Acidic Slime, Ohran) to produce a creature with BOTH trample AND deathtouch simultaneously. Per CR 702.19c, when an attacker with deathtouch has trample, only 1 damage is needed to be assigned to each blocker before the rest tramples — engine should split damage 1-to-each-blocker, rest-to-defending-player. May 25 audit revision: removed Whispersilk Cloak (the AI consistently preferred its shroud over Warhammer's trample, leaving Warhammer in hand). Added Hammer of Nazahn (auto-attaches Equipment when it enters), Demonic Tutor (find Warhammer directly), and Worldly Tutor (find Glissa/Ohran). This raises the probability that Warhammer attaches to a DT creature within the first 8-10 turns from ~10% to >50%.",
